{"title":"Gold Shield","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Armor Smithing Lv 39) · Monster drop: Thak Spearman, Thak Footman, Skeleton Knight</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 25 · STR 70 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Armor Smithing at level 39 <span class=\"muted\">(2430 XP)</span> from 6× <a href=\"#/item/gold-bar\">Gold Bar</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-spearman\" title=\"Thak Spearman - Normal, 0.2% of recorded drops (1 / 607 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4bb5ae8c7fe265fd4ca.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Spearman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.2%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-footman\" title=\"Thak Footman - Normal, 0.1% of recorded drops (1 / 1,552 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7bd0bd081dd39324d454.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Footman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.1%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"skeleton-knight\" title=\"Skeleton Knight - Normal, 0.6% of recorded drops (1 / 166 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/440f07a708d79a6d9303.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Skeleton Knight</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.6%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"gold-shield\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/armor-smithing\">Armor smithing</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/gold-shield\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/gold-shield?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/gold-shield?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/gold-shield?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gold-shield?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/gold-shield?q=good\">Good <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/gold-shield?q=excellent\">Excellent</a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/gold-shield?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/gold-shield?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. </p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gold-shield?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/a011baeea0e0c4dcdb3b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>4.6 shield defense</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gold-shield?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-crude\" src=\"data/img/a011baeea0e0c4dcdb3b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></td><td>-20%</td><td>5.3 shield defense</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gold-shield?q=shoddy\" title=\"Show it at Shoddy\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-shoddy\" src=\"data/img/a011baeea0e0c4dcdb3b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></td><td>-10%</td><td>5.9 shield defense</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"